_Derived L3 mirror — not the source. Authority: `AGENTS.md` + `decision-records/ADR-0014` + `knowledge/standards/coding-standard.md`. Edit the source, then regenerate here._
- Any change to the JSON shape requires three things together: (1) bump the version
  constant, (2) add a migration N->N+1, (3) a test migrating an old fixture to current.
- Zod is the single source: export inferred types, do not hand-write parallel
  interfaces (recursive nodes are the only exception, via `z.lazy`).
- Keep these packages tiny and dependency-light (zod only). No React, no antd,
  no platform code may enter here.
